Our Services
Title
What We Do
Text
Our specialists provide advanced care for brain, eye, spine, and nerve conditions, helping patients across Jharkhand, Bihar, West Bengal, and Chhattisgarh live healthier.
Neurology

We treat headaches, spine pain, and complex brain conditions common in our region.
Examples: Migraines, epilepsy, back pain, stroke recovery, Parkinson’s.
Learn About Neurology

Eye Care

We diagnose and treat eye and retina conditions, especially for diabetes or advanced cases.
Examples: Glaucoma, cataracts, diabetic eye issues, retina disorders.
Learn About Eye Care

